# 0.2 ONE-TIME UPDATE of config.properties (PROJECT-RULES 4, the SkyyArmory migrate021 steps): every tutorial.reward.<id> line still on
# its 0.1 default becomes the 0.2 one (Skyy Q1: combat = gear from the quest file, the rest coins + items - no more Skill XP); a hand-set
# line is KEPT + logged; tutorial.reward.explore_area is appended when absent (pure addition); a verified History copy first, one
# change-log line per changed key (status ok = Undo in Server Setup -> Changes; table key quests.tutorial.rewards[<id>], columns joined
# by |), the run-once marker comment (written before the first reward line), the file's bytes (ISO-8859-1) and line endings kept.
